---
description: Deploy every commit to the public Flick URL
alwaysApply: true
---

After committing and pushing Flick changes, they must appear on
https://temporary-brisk-mesa-ty777ur.vercel.app/

- `git push` runs `.githooks/pre-push`, which deploys with `npm run deploy`
  (`vercel deploy --yes --prod --temporary`) using `.vercel/anonymous.json`.
- If you commit without pushing, run `npm run deploy` before you finish.
- Do not commit `.vercel/anonymous.json` or Vercel tokens.
- Set `SKIP_DEPLOY=1` only when a push must skip the live site.
